{% block content %}
Because Zend donated the Zend Studio's Formatter upstream to the PDT project, the Formatter plugin for Zend Studio 10.1 need to be changed: replace  "com.zend.php" to "org.eclipse.php".

See  the updated file  <a href="http://www.dotkernel.com/download/?did=37" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DotKernel PHP Formatter for Zend Studio 10.1</a>

About PHP Formatter , see <a href="http://files.zend.com/help/Zend-Studio-10/zend-studio.htm#formatter.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">http://files.zend.com/help/Zend-Studio-10/zend-studio.htm#formatter.htm</a>

&nbsp;

Also, we created the templates file for Zend Studio 10.1 , according to DotKernel coding standard, see the file: <a href="http://www.dotkernel.com/download/?did=38" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Templates for Zend Studio</a>

About Templates in Zend Studio and how to import/export: <a href="http://files.zend.com/help/Zend-Studio-10/zend-studio.htm#templates.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">http://files.zend.com/help/Zend-Studio-10/zend-studio.htm#templates.htm</a>

